[17.618, "o", "[ 38.4s] answer:\r\nThe median NDVI in the area dropped from **0.837** in summer 2022 to **0.606** in summer 2024, a decrease of **0.231 units (27.6%)**. Across the forest of **698.7 ha**, **601.7 ha (86.1%)** showed a drop exceeding **0.1 NDVI units**. The largest affected patch is **580.68 ha** and centered at **(lon=9.42535, lat=39.23703)**; the next four largest patches range from **2.24 to 0.76 ha**. The full list of dropped patches is in [this GeoJSON file](outputs/mcp/compare_ndvi_2022_2024_7b9497.geojson).\r\n"]
